<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date as the Minister may, after consultation with the State Authority, appoint in relation to that State by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may, after consultation with the State Authority, appoint different dates for the coming into operation of this Act in different local authority areas or parts of local authority areas."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/28/eng@> .
