<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/28/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the avoidance of doubt, it is declared that notwithstanding anything contained in this Act, any law relating to the management of solid waste and public cleansing for the time being in force in any local authority area or non-local authority area shall continue to be in force unless and until this Act and the Solid Waste and Public Cleansing Management Act 2007 are brought into operation with respect to that area."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/28/eng@> .
